# Rule #1: Playback is sacred (1.1.20 simple embed on Android)

Video playback is the **heart** of SafeTube. Tags, UI, settings are secondary. **Stability beats everything.**

## Android path (FROZEN — what actually works)

```
Tap video → CleanPlayerYoutubeIframe → plain <iframe src=youtube.com/embed> → native YT controls
```

- **Android MUST use** simple iframe embed — **NOT** Media Bridge / googlevideo / hls.js in WebView (freezes/stops after ~1s)
- **NO** YouTube IFrame API (`useYoutubeIframePlayer`) — caused `insertBefore` crashes
- **NO** custom DOM controls over the player host
- **`youtubeEmbedUrl.ts`:** Android uses `host: 'youtube'` + `widget_referrer`
- **`MainActivity.java`:** `setMediaPlaybackRequiresUserGesture(false)` + third-party cookies

## Web/desktop path

Media Bridge + native `<video>` (unless `VITE_YOUTUBE_IFRAME_PLAYER=true`).

## Frozen files (no edits during feature work)

`CleanPlayer.tsx` (export routing + iframe attach), `youtubeEmbedUrl.ts`, `MainActivity.java` media/cookies, `streamApi.ts` (web path).

## Channel add

`channelStore.ts` — skip second `verify_parent_pin` when gate already unlocked.

## Never reintroduce

`useYoutubeIframePlayer.ts`, `youtubeIframeApi.ts`, `YoutubeStylePlayerControls.tsx`, forced Android → Media Bridge.
